      "body": "This is not going to be part of the 0.4.0 release which should happen in the next few weeks.\r\n\r\nThis *is* however going to be one of the next big features I'd like to tackle. If people are happy to share, I'd love to have some examples here of the kinds of things that we'd like to do with plugins so that we have some easy targets to start with.",
